      "id": "49e3588c-5984-4696-9b0d-38b641b197b4",
      "name": "Respond to Webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Serve Invoice PDFs\nBuilt: 2026-07-08 | Stateless webhook, no file storage\n\nTwilio's WhatsApp API fetches media from a URL rather than\naccepting attachments directly. This workflow exists solely to\nanswer that fetch: re-authenticates to Odoo and re-renders the\nrequested invoice fresh, every single call.\n\nMust be toggled **Active** (not just open) for the webhook to\nrespond — Test URL only fires once per manual click.",
        "height": 336,
        "width": 1392
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -880,
        -576
      ],
      "id": "122ac91f-3109-479d-8229-7f58842f6ebc",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Note on Odoo auth\nThis uses session-cookie auth (web login), NOT the same as the\nuid/JSON-RPC auth used in the main workflow's search_read calls.\nOdoo genuinely has two separate auth systems — this one is\nrequired specifically for the PDF report engine.",
        "height": 464,
        "color": "#FBDC0E"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        144,
        208
      ],
      "id": "3553ee78-7bb0-416e-aa84-cee94cfa39aa",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    }
  ],
